# Stage 9 golden tour (M7, D-036 style): the real game from the title with
# the run started in Café Zauner (`level = cafe_zauner`, the route's last
# station, D-047): START at frame 21, stage intro 21..170, then the inputs
# of cafe_zauner_solver.replay unchanged from frame 171 (re-copy them after
# `cargo xtask solve cafe_zauner --write`; the xtask tour coupling test
# checks it), then 3348 idle frames: the finale, the whole ending and the
# title with the „durchgespielt" mark (the replay ends there, 5789).
# Play frame = tour frame - 171 (stage clock likewise until the goal).
# The finale: the goal_stollen touched in the air (2441), the Serve after
# she lands, the tally (2536; its length follows the time left), the
# clear panel (2699), then the ending: Map 2879, Scene 3119, Bill 3479,
# Credits 4079 (6 pages of 180), Ende 5159, the marked title 5759. No
# shot of the title: this run starts in the café, so the title draws the
# café's backdrop, a debug-only view (D-111 observation 2); the marked
# title's shot is qa_m7_accept_full_route's (Salzburg).
# Shots, per section:
#   intro               60 „Etappe 9: Café Zauner"
#   1 Windfang          181 the glass door with the queue outside and the
#                       „Bus 150? / Wurscht!" board, 304 the tray bounce
#                       off Kellner #1 („Komm' gleich!")
#   2 Salon             475 chandeliers L1 and L2 over pens B and C
#   3 Die Schlange      686 the queue on its dots, mid-chain
#   4 Vor der Theke     892 the checkpoint („Zwischenstopp") beside
#                       „Reserviert / seit 1832"
#   5 Die Kuchentheke   1000 the arena lock, „Hinten anstellen!"; 1170 a
#                       dash (round 1, to the left wall); 1452 a breather
#                       stomp from the counter (hit 1, „Unerhört!"); 1755
#                       a volley (round 2, three bills); 2414 the third
#                       hit, the bell lifted („Bitte sehr!"); 2432 the bow
#   finale              2456 the Serve (the plate held up on the counter,
#                       „Zaunerstollen!"/10000 above it, E51: the pair
#                       appears as she lands at 2448), 2760 the
#                       clear panel („Mahlzeit, Resi!", E51)
#   ending              2999 Map, 3319 Scene, 3692 Bill, 4349 Credits
#                       page 2 (the cast), 5279 Ende
